# Keep the directory structure, READMEs, and the SYNTHETIC examples; exclude all
# real raw data. Real smoke/pilot/final data (and any pilot* / smoke* variant
# dirs), logs, run manifests, and large result blobs stay LOCAL and are not pushed.
# Synthetic example CSVs under examples/ are explicitly allowed (they test the
# scripts, not evidence).

# Ignore everything under data/ by default...
*

# ...but keep these versioned items:
!.gitignore
!README.md
!smoke/
!pilot/
!final/
!examples/
!examples/**
# keep phase-dir placeholders but nothing else inside them
smoke/*
pilot/*
final/*
!smoke/.gitkeep
!pilot/.gitkeep
!final/.gitkeep

# Never push raw/large artifacts, wherever they appear here.
*.jsonl
*.log
*.ndjson
